<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday!</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce4ec 0%, #f8bbd0 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 { color: #d81b60; font-size: 2.5rem; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { color: #880e4f; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .video-box {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 350px;
            background: white;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        video {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 15px;
            display: block;
        }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-weight: bold; color: #ad1457; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Happy Birthday! 🎂✨</h1>
    <p>Ek pyaara sa surprise aapke liye...</p>

    <div class="video-box">
        <!-- YAHAN apni video ka sahi naam likho (e.g. video.mp4) -->
        <video controls autoplay muted>
            <source src="your-video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">Made with ❤️ for You!</div>

</body>
</html>
